   Aggregates: COUNT(*)
   DataFusion Physical Plan: 
     : AggregateExec: mode=Single, gby=[true as __one_group], aggr=[count(1) FILTER (WHERE pinned_key_items_0.kind = Utf8View("none")) as agg_0, first_value(pinned_key_items_0.account_id) ORDER BY [pinned_key_items_0.ctid_0 ASC NULLS LAST] as row_0], ordering_mode=Sorted
     :   ProjectionExec: expr=[ctid@0 as ctid_0, account_id@1 as account_id, kind@2 as kind]
     :     CooperativeExec
     :       PgSearchScan: table=pinned_key_items, segments=1, visibility=eager, query={"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":"all"}},{"term":{"field":"account_id","value":1}}]}}
(10 rows)

