                 :   TantivyDecodeExec: decode=[kind]
                 :     AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[kind@1 as kind], aggr=[sum(pinned_key_items_0.price) as agg_0, first_value(pinned_key_items_0.account_id) ORDER BY [pinned_key_items_0.ctid_0 ASC NULLS LAST] as row_1]
                 :       TantivyFetchExec: fetch=[kind]
                 :         ProjectionExec: expr=[ctid@0 as ctid_0, kind@1 as kind, account_id@2 as account_id, price@3 as price]
                 :           CooperativeExec
                 :             PgSearchScan: table=pinned_key_items, segments=1, visibility=eager, query={"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":"all"}},{"term":{"field":"account_id","value":2}}]}}
