         DataFusion Physical Plan: 
           : AggregateExec: mode=Final, gby=[kind@0 as kind], aggr=[numeric64_sum(pinned_key_items_0.amount, 2) as agg_0, first_value(pinned_key_items_0.price) ORDER BY [pinned_key_items_0.ctid_0 ASC NULLS LAST] as row_1]
           :   TantivyDecodeExec: decode=[kind]
           :     AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[kind@1 as kind], aggr=[numeric64_sum(pinned_key_items_0.amount, 2) as agg_0, first_value(pinned_key_items_0.price) ORDER BY [pinned_key_items_0.ctid_0 ASC NULLS LAST] as row_1]
           :       TantivyFetchExec: fetch=[kind]
           :         ProjectionExec: expr=[ctid@0 as ctid_0, kind@1 as kind, price@2 as price, amount@3 as amount]
           :           CooperativeExec
           :             PgSearchScan: table=pinned_key_items, segments=1, visibility=eager, query={"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":"all"}},{"term":{"field":"price","value":1.0}}]}}
