\echo 'Test 6.3: pinned key with a nondeterministic collation -> declined'
Test 6.3: pinned key with a nondeterministic collation -> declined
-- The collation can call different bytes equal.
EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF, TIMING OFF)
SELECT kind, SUM(amount)
FROM pinned_key_items
WHERE label = 'label' AND id <= 12 AND id @@@ paradedb.all()
GROUP BY label, kind
ORDER BY kind;
WARNING:  Aggregate Scan not used: GROUP BY uses a nondeterministic collation. To disable this warning: SET paradedb.planner_warnings = 'off' (table: pinned_key_items)
                                                                                               QUERY PLAN                                                                                                
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Sort
   Sort Key: kind
   ->  HashAggregate
         Group Key: kind
         ->  Custom Scan (ParadeDB Base Scan) on pinned_key_items
               Table: pinned_key_items
               Index: pinned_key_items_idx
               Exec Method: NormalScanExecState
               Scores: false
               Tantivy Query: {"boolean":{"must":[{"range":{"field":"id","lower_bound":null,"upper_bound":{"included":12}}},{"with_index":{"query":"all"}},{"term":{"field":"label","value":"label"}}]}}
(10 rows)

